  "scope": "The Compiler returns the Language-owned source_module test inventory from the same frontend result used to verify callable roots and emit application-build/6. A fresh process can locate a prior artifact candidate across root snapshots; changed source still runs the full frontend before executable-closure reuse. Exact fresh-process reuse preserves the inventory; edits refresh source spans or the affected test identity, and invalid input publishes neither inventory nor artifact. A selected zero-argument source Test subset can now be emitted with the production entry, selected from the returned inventory, and executed in one canonical VM batch with Stage-0 agreement. This does not implement Language verification-fact reuse or change the production mncs-test consumer. A second workload reads the real mncs-test closure_suite sources, emits its two compiler-inventoried TestResult callables in one verified artifact, and runs both through one canonical VM batch with Stage-0 agreement; production runner and Forge integration remain separate."
}
